    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e99c78322c8d11cc2829c60b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来来来，训练员，在这边喔，这边！\n我期待已久而且吸引很多人瞩目的比赛\n终于要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b4362cebd9d48b03a78fba8c177e4c58604c08da8dff707de225f725346451",
